## 4. Method line

Searches run via the read toolset (no shell): per-slug exact-string Grep across `specs/system-deep-loop`, `specs` per track (`agents`, `sk-communication`, `sk-doc`, `system-speckit`, `cli-external-orchestration/073`, remainder tracks), `.skilled`, `.opencode`, `.pi`, `.claude`, `.codex`, `.cursor`, `.devin`, `.hermes`, `.github`, `repo-rules`, root docs (`README/CLAUDE/AGENTS/CONTRIBUTING/PUBLIC-RELEASE/BARTER`), `frontmatter-version-manifest.{json,csv}`, `specs/descriptions.json`, track-level JSON; glob-segmented Grep by filename (`goal.md`, `acceptance-criteria.md`, `implementation-summary.md`, `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `description.json`, `graph-metadata.json`, `*.frame`, `*.patch`, `*.jsonl`) for per-file enumeration; find sweeps for `**/<slug>` copy-roots across every specs track; cross-checked against the merge receipts (`baseline-file-counts.txt`, `baseline-census-external.txt`, `worklist.md`). Caps (100-match/50 KB) and the `File name too long` chains are the source of all `≥`/`obs` qualifiers.

